{"answer_text":"Several affordable CRMs now include email sequences without a separate sales-engagement tool. Good choices:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Northwind CRM** — the safe all-rounder: deep reporting and a large integration marketplace.\n2. **Tallyfox** — simple pipelines, a mobile app people actually use and pricing from $12 per user; reporting is lighter than the big suites.\n3. **Halcyon Sales** — great for outbound-heavy teams, overkill if you mostly handle inbound leads.\n\n**Bottom line:** Trial Northwind CRM and Tallyfox side by side with a real week of deals — the better fit is usually obvious by Friday.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50a3-7328-9fb9-de2d8029a720","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:08.750Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["crm email sequences pricing comparison"],"latency_ms":7490,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[129,142],[487,500]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[226,234],[505,513]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[368,381]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_re